			<div class="content" id="post-content-1624166">
									

<p><em>Creepycreepycreepycreepy. ergh.</em></p>
<blockquote>
<p>&quot;gonnae come and have an empty”.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Maybe the word &quot;empty&quot; has a different slang meaning in the region I live in, (Scottish btw), but here an &quot;empty&quot; is when your parents are away for a day or more, so you have a free house. Should you decide to have a house party while they are away, it will be referred to as an &quot;empty&quot;. Just wondering if my lols were unintentional.</p>

