			<div class="content" id="post-content-1625070">
									

<p>Correct, it's a small cottage on the top of a hill somewhere in a northern Scottish island.</p>
<p>It's believed that the vocal cords used to act like a audio encyclopedia and give out information on animals.</p>
<p>And that is to say, in blunt terms, the CI mutilated this house and stripped out some of the animals it used to be made of in order to experiment on them. So that the thing didn't collapse, they stapled, nailed and otherwise shoved bits of whatever objects were to hand in the empty spaces. It's a bit like ripping out an arm and shoving a table leg so that you don't bleed out.</p>

